              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شرجی (sharji) — \"muggy, humid (and hot)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تابستان در بندر هوا شرجی است. Tâbestân dar bandar havâ sharji ast. In summer the air in the port is muggy."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said of the Gulf coast in summer."
            }
          ]
        },
