            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رطوبت (rotubat) هوا امروز خیلی بالاست. Rotubat-e havâ emruz kheyli bâlâst. The humidity is very high today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Martub — humid."
            }
          ]
        },
