          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "rotubat was borrowed from Arabic and is usually traced to Arabic ruṭūba 'moisture, damp'. EtymDB does not list it."
