              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گرمازدگی (garmâzadegi) — \"heatstroke\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کارگر در آفتاب گرمازدگی گرفت. Kârgar dar âftâb garmâzadegi gereft. The worker got heatstroke in the sun."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "garmâ 'heat' + zade 'struck' + -gi."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "garmâzadegi is a native compound of garmâ 'heat', from garm 'warm', zade 'struck', from zadan 'to strike', and the noun ending -gi: being struck by the heat."
            }
          ]
        },
